{"id":"A2-L085","title":"Verb + object + bare infinitive: use","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U06","focus":"Verb + object + bare infinitive — uso","targets":{"grammar":"Verb + object + bare infinitive — uso","pron":"Schwa /ə/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["creative","flexible","feedback","team lead","work hours","flexible hours","coffee corner","new tool","software update","team lunch","reminder email","feedback session","creative idea","office rule","project deadline","team goal"],"field":"Planos","genre":"Entrevista","skill":"Fala","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 85 · Verb + object + bare infinitive: use","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verb + object + bare infinitive — uso.","**Pronúncia:** Schwa /ə/.","**10 palavras novas** (planos).","**Texto do dia:** entrevista."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar make, let, have e help sem to numa entrevista."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["creative","criativo"],["flexible","flexível"],["feedback","retorno"],["team lead","team lead"],["work hours","work hours"],["flexible hours","flexible hours"],["coffee corner","coffee corner"],["new tool","new tool"],["software update","software update"],["team lunch","team lunch"],["reminder email","reminder email"],["feedback session","feedback session"],["creative idea","creative idea"],["office rule","office rule"],["project deadline","project deadline"],["team goal","team goal"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An interview","blocks":[{"type":"iv","intro":"A manager talks about her team.","qa":[[